GridLens for DGX Spark
======================

Install the local package with apt, not dpkg, so Ubuntu/DGX OS can download
Docker and shared-library dependencies:

  sudo apt install ./gridlens_<version>_<arch>.deb

The GridLens application and Python libraries, including RAPIDS/cuDF, are
bundled under /opt/gridlens. Docker is installed through the package dependency
on docker.io or docker-ce.

The post-install script enables Docker and adds the sudo-invoking user to the
docker group when that user can be identified. Users may need to log out and
back in before Docker group membership is active.
